    <h3>Reference Docs</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-03/comparing-objects.html">Comparing Objects</a> — equals, null safety, compareTo</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-02/string.html">String Methods</a> — indexOf, substring, length</li>
        <li><a href="../exam/java-quick-reference.html">Java Quick Reference</a> — exact String methods on the AP exam</li>
    </ul>
</div>`;
